{"id":"some-egg","name":{"en":"Some Egg","ja":"何かのタマゴ"},"desc":{"en":"Something laid this. No one ever saw what did and no one knows what will hatch from it. You can make an omelet out of it, but that requires guts.","ja":"何かが産んだ、何かが産まれるであろう卵。 だが、産みの親が誰で、何が産まれるかは誰 も知らない。普通に料理に使えたりもするが、 食べるのはちょっと度胸がいる。"},"level":4,"locations":[{"id":"continental-coastline","name":{"en":"Continental Coastline","ja":"大陸海岸線"}},{"id":"arland-new-world","name":{"en":"Arland New World","ja":"アーランド新天地"}},{"id":"grand-horn","name":{"en":"Grand Horn","ja":"グラントホルン"},"parent":"primordial-island"}],"categories":[{"id":"fuel","name":{"en":"(Fuel)","ja":"（燃料）"},"icon":"totori-category-fuel"},{"id":"meat","name":{"en":"(Meat)","ja":"（食材・肉）"},"icon":"totori-category-meat"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":36}